sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Citizen / User
    participant UI as :ChatUI
    participant C as :QAController
    participant H as :ConversationHistory
    participant D as :OfficeDirectory

    U->>UI: askContactAndLocation("the ministry for this")
    UI->>C: getOfficeContact(request)
    Note over C: «Controller»<br/>The same use-case controller coordinates<br/>this flow, so the UI stays free of lookup<br/>logic
    C->>H: resolveProcedure(conversationId)
    H-->>C: procedure discussed earlier (UC-8 context)
    Note over H: «Information Expert»<br/>ConversationHistory knows what "this"<br/>refers to, because it holds the earlier<br/>conversation
    C->>D: findResponsibleOffice(procedure)
    alt online contact available
        D-->>C: ContactInfo(name, address, hours, phone,<br/>mapLink, sourceRef)
        C-->>UI: contact card + official source
        UI-->>U: showContactCard() + showSource()
    else no online contact available
        D-->>C: officeLocation + mapLink only
        C-->>UI: "No verified online contact information<br/>is available." + location
        UI-->>U: showNoContactNotice() + location + map link
    end
    Note over D: «Information Expert, High Cohesion»<br/>OfficeDirectory owns office records<br/>collected by UC-11, so it answers which<br/>office is responsible and what contact<br/>data is verified — it never guesses
    U->>UI: selectOpenInGoogleMaps()
    UI-->>U: openMap(officeLocation) in a new tab
